## Apply

```bash
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply
```

Terraform creates both LPGs simultaneously and establishes the peer connection
in a single apply. NSG rules are applied in the same pass.
{% if not manage_route_table %}
After apply completes, add the DG route rules manually as described above.
{% endif %}

